sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Executive
  participant A as API and one analyst loop
  participant S as Owner-scoped storage
  participant M as Gemini
  participant G as Query gateway
  participant B as BigQuery
  U->>A: Question and authenticated session
  A->>S: Resolve owner, scope, pinned persona and context
  S-->>A: Authorized context
  loop Until approval or shared limits
    A->>M: Goal, history, observations and tools
    M-->>A: Next tool call
    alt Analytical query
      A->>G: Proposed SQL and trusted context
      G->>G: Resolve virtual relations and enforce scope
      G->>B: Dry run, then admitted query with byte cap
      B-->>G: Bounded result and usage
      G-->>A: Evidence or safe error for next model call
    else Inspect or select previous evidence
      A->>A: Read bounded result, preserve population and provenance
    else Submit candidate
      A->>A: Check references and candidate identity
      A->>M: Tool-free evaluation against original question and evidence
      M-->>A: Approve, revise with issues, or stop
      alt Revise
        A->>A: Add feedback to the same agent conversation
      else Approve
        A->>A: Finalize exact approved content
        opt Explicitly authorized save
          A->>S: Idempotent save of final artifact
          S-->>A: Actual receipt
        end
      else Stop or review failure
        A->>A: Preserve completed evidence, mark incomplete
      end
    end
  end
  A-->>U: Approved answer or labelled partial result
